  text: "There\u2019s my favorite foreman! Alright, I got a tasty list for you here.
    How every worker's performance has been in the past years. The list goes as follows:
    1. Marcus Steeler, 2. Edvin Hammer, 3. Elsa Norden, 4. William Hammer, 5. Jane
    Layton, 6. Robert Lampard. And there you have it! Now you can optimally assign
    those meatheads. See? It pays off being friends with a guy like me."
